name: Source-bound triage outcomes retain automated authority through Review and Report
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
require-env: KUZUSHI_TRIAGE_TEST_BIN
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/triage_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
paste-file: @ART/open-second.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Second source revision | current-review
expect: synthetic review
ask: Does the second observation show the newly produced automated review, with uncertainty and labeled synthetic evidence rather than a verified vulnerability claim?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 Review | review-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 Review | review-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 Review | review-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 Review | review-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Review | review-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-page-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-page-5
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-page-6
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-page-7
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-page-8
ask: Can the operator read the automated verdict, its rationale and provenance at compact sizes using visible paging controls?
resize: 120x36
paste-file: @ART/open-first.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 First source revision | earlier-review
paste-file: @ART/open-second.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Second source revision | returned-review
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/triage_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART read
submit: decision deferred Owned review remains uncertain
require-live-snap: 25 Owned review remains uncertain | deferred
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Enter export | report
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/triage_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does the report preserve the observations and scripted human deferral without promoting synthetic automated review to proof or starting more model work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
paste-file: @ART/open-second.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Owned review remains uncertain | restarted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/triage_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
